@WebApiHostAddress = http://localhost:5127

### Liveness.
GET {{WebApiHostAddress}}/health

### Readiness: Kafka topics and consumer assignment are available.
GET {{WebApiHostAddress}}/health/ready

### Live risk alerts stream over SignalR at /riskHub (latest-only, best-effort view
### with reconnect and bounded dedupe; a disconnected client misses live events).
